    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Made This Game in 1 Year</strong><br>A fast-paced roguelike focused on deep meta progression, intense combat, and high replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your class:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Warrior</strong> \u2013 up-close and personal with heavy weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Mage</strong> \u2013 ranged spellcaster with powerful elemental attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Mentalist</strong> \u2013 manipulates enemies with psychic abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Main City Hub</strong> \u2013 unlock permanent upgrades, gear, and skill enhancements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Mining Mode</strong> \u2013 gather resources to craft and upgrade your equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fighting Mode</strong> \u2013 battle through endless waves of monsters with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Meta Progression</strong> \u2013 improve your characters permanently across all runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Build Variety</strong> \u2013 dozens of skills and upgrades to customize your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Enemy Variety</strong> \u2013 tons of monsters, unique spawn patterns, and challenging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>High Replayability</strong> \u2013 each run feels fresh with randomized elements and evolving difficulty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're grinding for resources, theorycrafting the perfect build, or just trying to survive one more wave \u2014 <strong>I Made This Game in 1 Year</strong> rewards your time and keeps the challenge coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaser Music: #Uppbeat (free for Creators!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store Assets:\u00a0lui.gg</p>",
